   "css": "right_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"right_col\"> <h3>How <span>to test?</span></h3> <p>Lie face down with your legs straight and arms at your sides. Gradually, lift one leg off the ground while keeping it straight. Repeat on other side. </p> <img src=\"https://betterhood.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Lying-leg-raise-duration.webp\"> </div>"
  },
  {
