   "description": "",
   "required": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "css": "dyk_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"dyk_wrapper\"> <div class=\"heading\"> <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/did_you_know_light_icon.svg\"> <h3>Did <span>You Know?</span></h3> </div> <p>The knee joint carres up to five times the body's weight during activities like running and jumping, making it one of the most heavily loaded joints in the body. </p> </div>"
