   "description": "",
   "required": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "css": "dyk_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"dyk_wrapper\"> <div class=\"heading\"> <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/did_you_know_light_icon.svg\"> <h3>Did <span>You Know?</span></h3> </div> <p>Our joints are all connected, like a game of dominos! When there’s a problem in the knee, it can tip the balance and lead to back pain, proving just how intertwined our body’s mechanics really are. </p> </div>"
