   "hidden": false,
   "css": "dyk_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"dyk_wrapper\"> <div class=\"heading\"> <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/did_you_know_light_icon.svg\"> <h3>Did <span>You Know?</span></h3> </div> <p>The patella, or kneecap, is a floating plate that glides over the knee joint, supported by muscles; tight thigh muscles can pull on the patella, causing friction and leading to knee problems. </p> </div>"
